BOARD-LEVEL QUESTION

Don't ask:

Was Medtronic hacked?

Ask:

If corporate IT is completely compromised tomorrow, what technical boundaries prevent an attacker from reaching the product, manufacturing, clinical, and patient-safety environments?

Then demand evidence.

